# NOTE: Content/ is NOT ignored. It is versioned in Git LFS - see
# .gitattributes. The one part of it that is generated is Content/Data/,
# rebuilt from data/*.json by Tools/import_data.py (roadmap M0.5). Whether
# generated DataTables are committed or built on demand is Codex's call;
# docs/DATA-PIPELINE.md states the tradeoff.
